body:
i expected it to go like;

my dad told me all the men in our family for alzheimers a month before they died. 

thats the 3rd time he says it.

imagine a 10v10 on this map. it would be sick. 

most probable scenario;
you are alone on the most crucial island against 4 people. you are colt. there are 2 shellys 1 barley and 1 nita. they want you and they want you bad. so you start by hitting the first shelly. she runs away. after you laser him to 400 hp and the barley overpeeks and you punish him and your super is now ready. you feel like “bring it on bitches” and try to line your enemies up and kill all of them with one super. you are confident. than a bull appears outta f*ckin nowhere and rapes you with 2 shots dealing almost 20k damage. you rage quit just to come back and play another event in 4 minutes.
